| **B3** | Determinant representation `det M(x) = pi(x)` | **CLOSED** (equivalence) | Best k=2 candidate over 12-feature library is `li(x) - log(x)·loglog(x)`, with sqrt(x)-scale error tracking li(x) - π(x) exactly. |
